{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n こんばちは\n \n もう夏服は買う必要ないのに\n やっぱり可愛いものを見つけると\n 買ってしまうんです。\n もうすぐに秋になるから\n 買っちゃダメなのに\n 買っちゃうんです。\n \n でももう本当に今日から\n 袖が切れてるやつは買わないと\n 約束します🤫\n \n 佐々木久美です。\n \n \n \n \n \n 土曜日の握手会のこと！\n \n \n 1・2部はとしちゃんとお揃いのワンピースを\n 着てたのですが写真が撮れませんでした😭\n 約束したのにごめんなさい😭\n \n 代わりに私たちのお揃いコレクション💘\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ35A6THXQYXP15125MHGPNQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n ふわちゃん🥺\n 私たちの元気の源なんです💘かあいい\n \n \n \n 🐡3・4部\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ35A7TGKR2AX1SJA84CQQ0Y","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ35A8S2BX7AMGS8TSMF2SSS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n ベージュのセットアップ着ました🌻\n 探検隊みたいだからテーマは\n 「あるある探検隊」でした🙌\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ35A9R03P3FQ48ZJS88K384","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n スタンドバイミーのTシャツ！ボボボンボン\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ35AAQFE7EG722RG66WNMQD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ35ABRJ5V3E66DB0BHW3XJA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ35ACQ3TDT7276BSAPN0X77","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ35ADQK7TZ88HWYAX5EK2P9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ35AERSHE5YSF9WYERXQRDN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ35AFTT7N0W9KJB2Z0W5QER","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ35AGT88D00829MJ8TJ3E3C","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 愛に溢れたお花たち💗\n ありがとうございます！\n \n \n \n そして、めいちゃんの生誕祭で\n お誕生日をお祝いしま